    <string name="guide_body">1. Connect the simulator on the Control tab.\n2. Hold up/down to move; release to stop.\n3. Tap a memory to move; hold to save.\n4. Set a standing threshold, goals and reminders.\n5. Inspect real BLE services on the Devices page. Hardware control is pending.\n\nLeaving the app or changing tabs stops movement.</string>
    <string name="maintenance_body">COFO control commands have not been verified. This version only discovers BLE services. For desk reset, troubleshooting and hardware locks, follow the official manual.</string>
    <string name="about_body">Independent COFO Desk research and implementation.\n\nIncludes an Android desk simulator, activity history and reminders. Real desk control and full compatibility remain unverified.\n\nSources: official COFO product pages and store screenshots.</string>
